5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the gap between the development vote and the unfunded running costs that appear later.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am curious about the actual outcomes of past initiatives. We need to know if they truly helped patients before adding more.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I worry about who actually absorbs the new workload. Rosters rarely match the requesting department, so I need to see the staffing reality.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
