60,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, the tariffs confirm off-site visits earn nothing. Option A is financially void. We must choose a program that generates on-site revenue to sustain itself.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, you mistake revenue for value. The call-back trial proved home visits cut readmissions by a fifth. Option A is the only model with proven, self-sustaining efficacy.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I hear the efficacy, but Option A lands on nine vacant nursing posts. We cannot add home visits to a team already drowning in agency cover.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
